    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d136">

                <pb facs="0268" n="212" xml:id="pg212"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Department of the Army Files</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President to the Secretary of War</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Stimson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1944-09-08">September 8, 1944</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Memorandum for the Secretary of
                        War</hi></p>
                <p>As a result of years of Fascist and Nazi rule and the destruction resulting from
                    the battles on its soil, I understand that the supply situation in Italy is
                    critical.</p>
                <p>This situation should be corrected as effectively and as quickly as possible.</p>
                <p>The War Department should, therefore, take immediate action to make available the
                    additional essential civilian supplies and shipping necessary to remedy this
                    condition.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Franklin</hi> D. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
